;    0: TWdLink(count=6995, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Outside, everything was lit by moonlight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The rain has stopped completely, and a fresh night wind blows through.<PG>
But even if the wind is fresh, the air is stagnant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As time passes, I feel a sinister current flowing from somewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's the same air I felt from <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Blindly devoted to Verde, willing to use any means to their ends―
{PAUSE ""}
the pitch-black air that people like that give off.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\荒田集集会所夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
One by one, residents began to appear from the houses.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wearing Noh masks and red robes, they go into the meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What are they planning to start at this hour?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surely they're not holding <STYLE ID="4">Mom's</STYLE> third-year memorial service now, of all times.<PG>
Even as I watched the settlement from up in the tree like this, I was going back over my conversation with <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I finally realized what had been nagging at me in that conversation with <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> said 'I haven't had the shot,' yet she was in that state.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably, injecting that so-called Goddess's blood makes you like <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So at first I'd thought <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> getting like that without an injection was an act, but...<PG>
It seems <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> has been accepted as one of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And she received the Goddess's blood from <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> is someone I never mentioned to <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, so at the very least she must have had contact with <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the very least, there must have been enough communication for her to learn <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san's</STYLE> name.<PG>
At that point, being one of them without the injection isn't something <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> could <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="だま">bluff</STYLE> her way through by acting alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> really did end up like that without an injection.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's what had been nagging at me―that <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> was accepted as one of them unconditionally.<PG>
But beyond that, I haven't got a clue.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I can join up with <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>, we might find a way to save <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\荒田集集会所夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "1000" "PASS"}
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Two strikingly small figures are approaching the meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those are...
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE>...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> had been sticking with <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> all along.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> is walking on her own feet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She doesn't seem to be hurt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But those two are the only ones without Noh masks and red robes.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> seems to be pointing a knife at <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>, forcing her to walk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That means <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> is walking because she's being threatened, which means she should still be sane.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want to get her out somehow, but against <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> I don't stand a chance, and even a surprise attack probably won't work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only option is to watch for an opening and get her out...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The two of them went into the meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So something is going to start in the meeting hall.<PG>
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's...
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> is with <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> must have joined up with <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> at some point.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> isn't holding a knife, and <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> is heading for the meeting hall without any hesitation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's the decisive difference from <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> is going to the meeting hall of her own will.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's going to start in this meeting hall?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> aside, if they're even taking <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> there... I've got a bad feeling about this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe they're going to force a shot of this Goddess's blood or whatever into <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I don't get her out fast, it'll be too late...!<PG>
Come to think of it, <STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE> is the only one I don't see.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is she already inside the meeting hall?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anyway, once I see something happen, I'll check on what's going on inside, get <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> out when I see an opening, and look for a way to bring <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> back to normal.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "タイトル鈴.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "700" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Things are getting noisy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is that the sound of drums, or bells?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've never heard a sound like this at any rite before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll climb down from the tree and scout out what's happening inside.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50逆.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I open the meeting hall's door a crack and quietly <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="のぞ">peek</STYLE> inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\軍団.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A crowd of residents wearing Noh masks and red robes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the Niimura family are dressed as usual.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> are there too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> has her hands tied behind her back, apparently a captive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> isn't tied up, and stands in line alongside the Niimura family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then something dangling and swaying catches my eye.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神首つり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "T" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The Verde mummy has been <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="つ">hung</STYLE> up, and a torch is <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="た">burning</STYLE> beside it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just like when I saw it at the Niimura house, a little blood is dripping from the mummy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, that blood had soaked into the red robes, not the mummy, but what's the point of that?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At least it doesn't look like fake blood.<PG>
By the looks of it, the Niimura family and <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> are something like the leaders of this so-called Verde faith?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looks like <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> is the one <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="たた">beating</STYLE> this ear-piercing drum.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> has been made to kneel near the front, and <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> is holding the rope that binds <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And in the center, <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.<PG>
What happened to <STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is it because <STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE> is the Grand Witch that she'll make her entrance at the big moment?<PG>
Either way, I've never seen a rite like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And anyway, what happened to <STYLE ID="4">my mom's</STYLE> third-year memorial service...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the merit-adding prayers for <STYLE ID="4">my mom</STYLE>...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Everyone, today is April 8. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I believe you all know what day today is."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At last <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, standing in the middle, spoke.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why is <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> running things?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Isn't this kind of thing supposed to be done by <STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE>, the Grand Witch?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Today is the first-anniversary memorial for my mother... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="8">Sakura Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and it has been exactly a year since Lady Verde appeared."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\Ghost長い.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san's</STYLE> first-anniversary memorial!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If Verde appeared on the same day, does that mean that's when the Verde mummy was found?
